WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.525
They thought he was a beggar.

00:00:01.535 --> 00:00:02.825
He designed this.

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.451
Barcelona, 1926.

00:00:04.461 --> 00:00:06.826
A tram hits an old man on

00:00:06.836 --> 00:00:08.236
the Gran Via.

00:00:08.336 --> 00:00:09.991
His clothes are shabby.

00:00:10.029 --> 00:00:11.656
People take him for a beggar, and

00:00:11.666 --> 00:00:13.203
help is slow to come.

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:15.138
Only the next day does a chaplain

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:16.286
recognise him.

00:00:16.296 --> 00:00:18.385
He dies on June 10th, and he's

00:00:18.395 --> 00:00:21.240
buried inside his own unfinished building.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.660
And it gets worse.

00:00:22.673 --> 00:00:24.775
Ten years later, a fire burns his

00:00:24.785 --> 00:00:26.970
plans and smashes his models.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.469
His collaborators rebuild
the models, and the

00:00:29.479 --> 00:00:30.713
work goes on.

00:00:30.723 --> 00:00:33.410
In February 2026, its main tower is

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.180
finished.

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:36.780
It's now the tallest church in the

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:37.422
world.

00:00:37.525 --> 00:00:39.640
The beggar was Antoni Gaudí.

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:42.675
His Sagrada Família still isn't finished.
